# Everything in this file is OPTIONAL. dsaMixer runs without a .env: it stores your data in
# dsamixer.db (SQLite) and the board, planner and stats all work. Copy this file to .env
# (`cp .env.example .env`) and uncomment only what you want. Never commit .env.

# --- Database -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default: SQLite file dsamixer.db in this folder. Set this only if you want Postgres instead.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@localhost:5432/dsamixer

# --- Email reminders (morning plan, evening nudge) ------------------------------------------
# Use a personal Gmail with an App Password: https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/185833
# Steps: docs/guides/integrations.md
# SMTP_USER=you@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
# MAIL_TO=you@gmail.com
# APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765

# --- Weekly AI planner (AI course tab) ---------------------------------------------------------
# Set ONE of these. OpenRouter is used when its key is present (https://openrouter.ai/keys).
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# Any OpenRouter model that supports structured outputs:
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
